      "comment": [
        "Pre-adolescent girls with a taste for the worst kind of crap the majors put on record.",
        "Annoying little brats who want to be tough. Wear baggy t-shirts and ride bmx-bikes.",
        "Fourteen year olds with ponytails and braces.",
        "Hockey boys who'll never grow up. Thirteen years and up. Often racist.",
        "Fashion-sensitive big city girls. Like anything with a cool video.",
        "Rednecks. Eighties rock give them a sense of freedom. Never sober. Shoot road signs for fun on a Friday night.",
        "Pretentious intellectuals. Like jazz, French chansons and secretely admire kitschy gay divas.",
        "Credibility junkies. Always down with the newest. Broad (\"eclectic\") taste in music. Very selective. Take pride in liking the odd song on the Top 10 (\"a good song is a good song\").",
        "Ladies. Like languishing male opera singers gone pop. Also weak for pan-flutes.",
        "Gentlemen. Listen to music only when driving. Enjoy big band jazz and old guys doing pelvic thrusts on stage.",
        "Pop nerds. Burn for wimpy pop and find most music \"sell-out\".",
        "Puritan rock fetishists. Only listen to ivory-white rock by balding guitar heroes. Get very upset about music that isn't made with \"real instruments\".",
        "Suburban teenage girls. Wear lots of make up, chew lots of gum and dance in salsa-joints. Like commercial dance music with heavy beats.",
        "Suburban men stuck in nowhere. Like lager and barbecue, and dream of owning their home. Totally into testosterone rock from ten years ago.",
        "Punks. Live where you least expect them and like punkrock. Multiply by fission at festivals.",
        "Heavy metal-fans. Wear long hair and like heavy metal. Always play in cover bands themselves and have an astounding knowledge of obscure artists of the genre.",
        "New wave fans. Appreciate nazi-symbolism and electronic beats. Dye their hair white and never smile. Studied German in school.",
        "Passionate music lovers. Genuinely interested in music and own gigantic record collections. Very passionate about music but lack social skills.",
        "Passionate music lovers. Genuinely interested in music and own gigantic record collections. Very passionate about music but lack social skills.",
        "Girls. Like horoscopes, cozy candle-lit evenings at home and world music."
